---
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2>Data, visualized and made useful</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>
          I'm in my sixth semester of a B.Sc. in Data Science at Telkom University, focused on
          data visualization, analytics, big data, and time series forecasting. I like working
          end to end: building the ETL pipeline and the forecasting model, then the dashboard and
          visuals that make the results usable for someone who isn't a data scientist.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before this, I studied Software Engineering at SMK Telkom Purwokerto, where I picked up
          database management, UI/UX design, and web development, a background that still shows
          up in how I think about interfaces for data products today.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="honors reveal">
        <div class="honor-item">
          <div class="h-label">Honor</div>
          <div class="h-value">Astra 1st 2026 Scholarship Awardee</div>
        </div>
        <div class="honor-item">
          <div class="h-label">Honor</div>
          <div class="h-value">Telkom University Endowment Fund 2026 Awardee</div>
        </div>
        <div class="honor-item">
          <div class="h-label">Focus areas</div>
          <div class="h-value">
            Data Visualization &middot; Analytics &middot; Big Data &middot; Machine Learning
            &middot; Time Series
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 90px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-grid p {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 22px 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .honors { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; }
  .honor-item { padding-top: 18px; }
  .honor-item .h-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .honor-item .h-value { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
